   "body": "/claim mac/m4-captures\n\n- The method of #347: the real legacy stores write synthetic data from an XCTest exporter in the legacy test host, and the bytes are copied out. The legacy build is `origin/master` `21173e77`, because `reply_active_drafts_by_topic_v1` does not exist at the oracle's `2440d79`. It runs on a simulator with no account and no HFR request of its own.\n- `BlackList.m` (`blackListDico.plist`, `whiteList.plist`, and the v0 `blackList.plist` migration path), `AddMessageViewController -modifyBrouillon:` (`brouillon`), and `ReplyDraftStore.saveActiveText` (`reply_active_drafts_by_topic_v1`): empty and typical states, plus edge cases where the code allows them.\n- Samples go in `tooling/legacy-oracle/samples/legacy-stores/` with their provenance; the LOT-067 decoders are checked against them in `LegacyFormatsTests`. One draft PR `capture/709-legacy-lists-drafts`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
