   "updated_at": "2026-11-10T15:03:46Z",
   "body": "### Capture result\n\nPR #743 holds 20 samples, produced 2026-11-10 by the legacy code at `21173e77` on synthetic data (method of #347). The MANIFEST section \"Legacy on-device samples\", block #709, records the provenance and storage location of each.\n\n- **What the legacy app writes:**\n  - `blackListDico.plist`: account → `[{word, alias, mode}]`, XML plist.\n  - `whiteList.plist`: a global array.\n  - `brouillon`: a string, `\"\"` after use.\n  - `reply_active_drafts_by_topic_v1`: JSON data, newest first, at most 50 topics, the key deleted on the last removal.\n- **`brouillon`'s writer:** it is not in the `HFRswift` app (`SuperHFRplus` target only), so its one line is transliterated.\n- **v0 migration:** it leaves no list file on disk until the next save.\n- **The importer:** the LOT-067 decoders read every sample as expected (`LegacyListsDraftsSamplesTests`). No merged code must change; the v0 finding is recorded in the LOT-067 spec.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
